---
/**
 * / — server-side 307 to /research.
 *
 * Intentionally NOT prerendered: a prerendered redirect emits a static
 * index.html with meta-refresh, which the browser renders briefly before
 * navigating (visible flash). SSR returns a real HTTP 307 with no body so
 * the browser navigates immediately.
 */
return Astro.redirect('/research', 307);
---
